From: Aayush Gupta <aayushgupta219@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 11 May 2021 14:38:54 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Jelly: MainActivity: Replace applyThemeColor with setUiMode

This ensures that mWebView has been initialized before accessing it.
Also, setUiMode calls applyThemeColor

Observed crash in logs without this patch:

