(cherry picked from commit 01ec94e3ce890df7a2d5300929e7e5ead99f8bbe)

lineage-17.1 never got this; it landed in lineage-18.1 and every branch
since. The hunk context is this tree's rather than upstream's, which has
no semicolon after registerOnSharedPreferenceChangeListener(this); the
change is the same two lines.

Signed-off-by: Artem Bambalov <artembambalov1993@gmail.com>
---
 app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/jelly/MainActivity.kt | 3 +--
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 2 deletions(-)

--- a/app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/jelly/MainActivity.kt
+++ b/app/src/main/java/org/lineageos/jelly/MainActivity.kt
@@ -169,7 +169,6 @@
         val preferenceManager = PreferenceManager.getDefaultSharedPreferences(this)
         preferenceManager.registerOnSharedPreferenceChangeListener(this);
 
-        setUiMode()
         val incognitoIcon = findViewById<ImageView>(R.id.incognito)
         incognitoIcon.visibility = if (mIncognito) View.VISIBLE else View.GONE
         setupMenu()
@@ -186,7 +185,7 @@
                 findViewById(R.id.search_menu_next),
                 findViewById(R.id.search_menu_cancel),
                 this)
-        applyThemeColor(mThemeColor)
+        setUiMode()
         try {
             val httpCacheDir = File(cacheDir, "suggestion_responses")
             val httpCacheSize = 1024 * 1024.toLong() // 1 MiB
